      "body": "@noooop could you add the `ready` label so CI can run? `vllm bench sweep plot_pareto` says it falls back to `num_gpus` / `gpu_count` when `--gpu-count-var` is unset, but it only uses TP × PP × DP, so per-GPU throughput is wrong for records that have those fields. This makes it use them first.",
